WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.018
1. Home is your to-do list. Each tile shows contracts waiting for you; click one to open them.

2
00:00:03.018 --> 00:00:07.252
2. Urgent lists notice deadlines that have passed or are due within a week, each with what to do.

3
00:00:07.252 --> 00:00:12.618
3. Click Search or press Ctrl+K to find any contract or supplier by name, reference or SAP number.

4
00:00:12.618 --> 00:00:17.766
4. Use the menu to move around: Contracts, Renewals and Suppliers.

5
00:00:17.766 --> 00:00:25.526
5. Click ? beside any page title for help with that screen, or open Help from the menu.
